#: ../developer/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"HybridInference is an open-source LLM inference gateway. It puts one "
"OpenAI-compatible HTTP API in front of inference servers you run yourself"
" (vLLM, SGLang, Ollama or any other OpenAI-compatible server) and hosted "
"provider APIs, and picks for each request which of them answers."
msgstr ""
"HybridInference 是一个开源的 LLM 推理网关。它对外提供一套 OpenAI 兼容的 HTTP "
"API，背后可以接你自己部署的推理服务器（vLLM、SGLang、Ollama 或其他任何 OpenAI 兼容的服务器）和托管的 provider"
" API，并为每个请求挑选由谁来回答。"

#: ../developer/index.rst:9
msgid ""
"A client asks for a *model id*, and the gateway decides which *endpoint* "
"serves it. One id can have several routes, so the gateway can split "
"traffic by weight, fail over when an endpoint degrades, and price and log"
" every request while the client keeps sending the same id."
msgstr ""
"客户端请求的是一个\\ *模型 id*\\ ，由网关决定哪个\\ *端点*\\ 来处理。一个 id "
"可以有多条路由，所以网关可以按权重分流、在端点变差时回退，并为每个请求计价、记录日志，而客户端始终发送同一个 id。"

#: ../developer/index.rst:14
msgid ""
"This site documents the gateway software, not any one deployment of it. "
"Which models a gateway serves, and how to get an account on it, are up to"
" its operator."
msgstr "本站介绍的是网关软件本身，不针对任何一个具体部署。某个网关提供哪些模型、怎样在上面开账号，由它的运营方决定。"

#: ../developer/index.rst:19
msgid "What is in the box"
msgstr "包含哪些部分"

#: ../developer/index.rst:21
msgid ""
"**OpenAI-compatible API**: ``/v1/chat/completions``, ``/v1/embeddings``, "
"``/v1/responses``, ``/v1/models`` and the Batch API (``/v1/files``, "
"``/v1/batches``), plus Anthropic's Messages API at ``/v1/messages`` and "
"``/anthropic/v1/messages``."
msgstr ""
"**OpenAI 兼容 "
"API**：``/v1/chat/completions``、``/v1/embeddings``、``/v1/responses``、``/v1/models``"
" 和 Batch API（``/v1/files``、``/v1/batches``），另有 Anthropic 的 Messages "
"API：``/v1/messages`` 和 ``/anthropic/v1/messages``。"

#: ../developer/index.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Routing**: a router per model, weighted selection, fallback to the next"
" route and a circuit breaker per endpoint."
msgstr "**路由**：每个模型可选自己的 router，按权重挑选路由，失败时回退到下一条路由，每个端点都有熔断器。"

#: ../developer/index.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Adapters**: a generic OpenAI-compatible adapter, which also serves "
"local servers, and dedicated adapters for OpenRouter, Anthropic, Claude "
"on Google Vertex and Gemini."
msgstr ""
"**adapter**：一个通用的 OpenAI 兼容 adapter（本地服务器也用它），以及 "
"OpenRouter、Anthropic、Google Vertex 上的 Claude 和 Gemini 的专用 adapter。"

#: ../developer/index.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Console**: a Next.js app for sign-up, API keys, usage, request history "
"and a chat playground, with an admin area for users, providers, models, "
"routing and settings."
msgstr ""
"**控制台**：一个 Next.js 应用，提供注册、API key、用量、请求记录和对话 "
"playground，以及管理用户、provider、模型、路由和设置项的管理后台。"

#: ../developer/index.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Postgres**: accounts, API keys, the request log and the gateway's "
"configuration. The schema comes only from the migrations in "
"``apps/backend/migrations/``; the service issues no DDL."
msgstr ""
"**Postgres**：保存账号、API key、请求日志和网关的配置。表结构只来自 ``apps/backend/migrations/`` "
"中的迁移；服务本身不执行任何 DDL。"

#: ../developer/index.rst:37
msgid ""
"The backend is Python 3.11–3.13 under ``apps/backend/``: ``serving/`` "
"holds the HTTP API, authentication, adapters, storage and observability, "
"and ``routing/`` the route table, strategies, endpoint health and "
"fallback. The console is Next.js under ``apps/frontend/``."
msgstr ""
"后端是 ``apps/backend/`` 下的 Python 3.11–3.13 代码：``serving/`` 包含 HTTP "
"API、鉴权、adapter、存储和可观测性，``routing/`` 包含路由表、路由策略、端点健康和回退。控制台是 "
"``apps/frontend/`` 下的 Next.js 应用。"

#: ../developer/index.rst:42
msgid ""
"A deployment keeps its identity, branding and model catalog in its own "
"database, and its code and assets in a *distribution overlay* under "
"``distributions/``. A fresh clone is therefore nobody's gateway but your "
"own; see :doc:`distribution-customization`."
msgstr ""
"每个部署把站点信息、品牌和模型目录保存在自己的数据库里，把代码和资源放在 ``distributions/`` 下的\\ *发行版 "
"overlay*\\ 里。所以新克隆的仓库不属于任何人，跑起来就是你自己的网关；见 :doc:`distribution-"
"customization`。"

