#: ../developer/index.rst:88
msgid ""
"HybridInference is developed by the `Harvard MadSys Lab "
"<https://juncheng.seas.harvard.edu/>`_ at the Harvard John A. Paulson "
"School of Engineering and Applied Sciences and published under the `MIT "
"license "
"<https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/blob/main/LICENSE>`_. "
"Its RouteWise router is the subject of the lab's EuroSys '27 paper and "
"ships separately as the MIT-licensed `llm-routewise "
"<https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/RouteWise>`_ library; this gateway is "
"its production reference integration."
msgstr ""
"HybridInference 由哈佛大学 John A. Paulson 工程与应用科学学院的 `Harvard MadSys Lab "
"<https://juncheng.seas.harvard.edu/>`_ 开发，以 `MIT 许可证 "
"<https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/blob/main/LICENSE>`_ "
"发布。它的 RouteWise router 是该实验室 EuroSys '27 论文的研究内容，并作为采用 MIT 许可的 `llm-"
"routewise <https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/RouteWise>`_ "
"库单独发布；本网关是它在生产环境中的参考集成。"

